   "text": "Failure handling\n\u2022 agent crash / stall \u2192 retry once \u2192 fail loud with context, resume later\n\u2022 schema-invalid output = failed step\n\u2022 budget reached \u2192 clean stop, partial run saved\n\u2022 failed revision of approved copy \u2192 last approved version stays live",
